# A throwaway key that holds a little USDC on the payment network (Arc's gas token is USDC). Never commit it.
# A key that other tutorials also use shares one box, and `npm run cleanup` empties it.
PRIVATE_KEY=
API_URL=https://api.arcgate.dev
ARC_RPC_URL=https://rpc.mainnet.arc.io
# Where arcgate pushes messages. https only; it must answer the ownership challenge before anything is delivered.
WEBHOOK_URL=https://192.0.2.10/arc-agent-box
# The token the watch step watches, searched for once to make the index report it. Optional: a default is built in.
# Set to a token the localnet has not checked when the default no longer fires.
# WATCH_TOKEN=
# Localnet (the arcgate checkout's `pnpm localnet`): API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:19800 and ARC_RPC_URL=the Arc testnet RPC.
